# Distant cloud relayout

Reuses eleven distinct modules painted from the MyPSB cloud brush catalog: 01, 03, 04, 06, 07, 08, 09, 12, 13, 17, 20. No module is repeated. Brush 08 forms a broad bank in the northwest sector. Other modules have varied arc widths, partial overlaps and radial placement offsets. Placement.json records exact parameters.

Polar transform maps upright module crowns inward and bases outward. Lower alpha retains the previous soft visible-edge treatment. RGB shading and alpha coverage remain separate. Final packed texture is 4096 square; module sheet source resolution is retained in GeneratedSheet.png and is not native 4K per module.

Target: /Game/RXSkySystem/Cubeless/PaintedCloud/v04/Altitude/Rejected/T_CloudLook_ClearZenith_B_Distant_v10. User requested overwrite. Before_Relayout.uasset.bak preserves the previous saved asset. Previous source art remains in UniqueBrushRevision. Level assignments are unchanged.
